Source: piano-sensors
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: piano mainline contributors <piano@localhost>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: piano-sensors
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         dmsetup,
         erofs-utils,
         fastrpc-support (>= 1.0.7),
         iio-sensor-proxy (>= 3.9-1+piano1),
         kmod,
         libssc-bin,
         mount,
         python3
Conflicts: droid-juicer, hexagonrpcd
Description: Sensors support for the Xiaomi Pad 8 Pro (piano)
 Imports the sensors PD inputs from the tablet's own partitions on first
 boot (the JSON configuration from odm, the registry and calibration from
 persist, both opened read-only), serves the ADSP sensors PD with
 adsprpcd, and sets up iio-sensor-proxy for the SM8750 sensors hub:
 accelerometer mount matrix and start order.
